{"id":"ff71492a4521b739","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-thm-ideal-saturated.md","title":"Saturated Ideal Theorem","display":"thm-ideal-saturated — Saturated Ideal Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-ideal-saturated","aliases":["58-thm-ideal-saturated"],"display":"thm-ideal-saturated — Saturated Ideal Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-ideal-saturated"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-ideal-saturated</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ideal-saturated — Saturated Ideal Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,X,\\kappa,F\\in V\">\\(I,X,\\kappa,F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\)</span> (unambiguous ideal-saturation predicate characterized here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\)</span> (legacy alias retained here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturated}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land X\\notin I\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists F\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\n(\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to F(\\alpha)\\cap F(\\beta)\\in I)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturated}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land X\\notin I\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists F\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\n(\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to F(\\alpha)\\cap F(\\beta)\\in I)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-saturated ideal has no <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-almost-disjoint family of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>-positive sets of size <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>. Distinct indices are now expressed by a well-formed two-variable clause rather than the malformed binder <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\beta\\in\\kappa\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\beta\\in\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The explicit name avoids confusing ideal saturation with the satisfaction relation's common abbreviation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sat}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Saturation of the nonstationary ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> is sensitive to additional axioms and large-cardinal consistency strength.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,X,\\kappa,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal},\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S,\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}_S(I,X,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturated}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\n\\land X\\notin I\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\\\\n&{}\\to\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg\\exists F\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus I)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\n(\\alpha\\neq\\beta\\to F(\\alpha)\\cap F(\\beta)\\in I)\n\\Bigr)\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}saturated\\text{-}legacy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sat}_S(I,X,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IdealKappaSaturated}_S(I,X,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\beta\\in\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_1","display":false}],"bytes":1786,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4219","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-thm-ideal-saturated.md|58-thm-ideal-saturated]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","5fb1c2241d1943d1","36d7463d215be751"]}